[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 2. **Permission bitmask** (`safe_add` arg 3, `check_permissions` args) — the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    library's only "flag word". Distinct states: contains `0600`, missing
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    `0400`, missing `0200`, missing both, zero, negative / high-bit set,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    `required == 0`, `required` a superset.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 3. **Pointer nullity** on every pointer parameter (`op`, `src`, `op1`, `op2`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    `log_msg`) — see ERRORS.md.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 4. **Input shape for `copy_and_sum`**: `count` = 0 / 1 / 2 / 3 / many, plus
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    negative and huge (ERRORS.md rows 11–14). The `int[3]` shape is the only one
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    `complexmode` mode 3 ever produces.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 5. **String shape for `create_result_string` / `compare_operations`**: empty,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    one char, many, high-bit (non-ASCII) bytes, embedded-`%` format-looking
